      "type": "beneficial",
      "mechanism": "pest_repellent",
      "description": "Sage repels cabbage moth and cabbage looper; the traditional pairing of European kitchen gardens. Aromatic perimeter planting works best.",
      "strength": "moderate",
      "source": "Cornell Cooperative Extension; Cunningham, Great Garden Companions"
    },
